q=get(1845,2);q['stem']='An added ROS2 timing test reports a mean end-to-end latency of 2 ms for a task with a 10 ms deadline, but supplies no worst-case bound or scheduler/workload analysis. Which conclusion follows from the source’s real-time support claim?';q['assumptions']=['The timing values are added illustration, not measured source performance. No worst-case latency, jitter bound or workload/configuration proof is supplied.']
